# Credentials. freesound.key is the "Client secret/Api key" from the credential
# page and doubles as the OAuth2 client secret; the token file holds a live
# session. Neither belongs anywhere near a remote.
freesound.key
freesound-oauth.key
freesound-oauth-token.json

# Build output. Regenerated from freesound-raw.json in about ten minutes, and
# four megabytes of inlined payload does not want a revision each time. The
# cache itself IS committed - it is thousands of API requests and the one thing
# here that cannot simply be rebuilt.
producer-graph.html
index.html

*.log
__pycache__/
.venv/
